 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "lassen: to have something done",
     "texto": [
      "With **lassen** + infinitive, the subject doesn't do the action: **Ich lasse das Dach reparieren** (I'm having the roof repaired). The infinitive goes at the end.",
      "Conjugation: **ich lasse, du lässt, er/sie lässt, wir lassen, ihr lasst, sie lassen**. Note: **du lässt** has an umlaut."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "lass!: leave it",
     "texto": [
      "With the imperative, **Lass das!** means \"leave it!\" and **Lass mich in Ruhe!** means \"leave me alone!\".",
      "Watch out for the false friend: **lassen** doesn't always mean \"to leave something somewhere\". If an infinitive follows, it means \"to have something done\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
